{"path":"memory/gc/declare_no_pointers","title":"std::declare_no_pointers","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>declare_no_pointers","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/memory/gc/declare_no_pointers","section":"memory","kind":"page","summary":"Informs the garbage collector or leak detector that the specified memory region (n bytes beginning at the byte pointed to by p) contains no traceable pointers.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/memory\">&lt;memory&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11 t-until-cxx23\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">void</span> declare_no_pointers<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">char</span> <span class=\"sy2\">*</span>p, <a href=\"/w/cpp/types/size_t\"><span class=\"kw107\">std::<span class=\"me2\">size_t</span></span></a> n <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> <br><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-until-cxx23\">(removed in C++23)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Informs the garbage collector or leak detector that the specified memory region (<code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">n</span></code> bytes beginning at the byte pointed to by <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">p</span></code>) contains no traceable pointers. If any part of the region is within an allocated object, the entire region must be contained in the same object.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> p\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> pointer to the beginning of the range\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> n\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<t